// Fuzzer stub for libtorrent::bencode(OutIt, const entry&)
// Goal: exercise bencoding of various entry shapes while constraining sizes.
// Inputs: `entry` (libtorrent::entry*) provided by the runtime pool. We own and may mutate it.
// Outputs: return `entry` to the pool (we do not destroy it).
{
